meta {
  name: EC10 Working hours end while TAT running
  seq: 11
}

script:pre-request {
  if (!bru.getVar("baseUrl")) bru.setVar("baseUrl", "http://localhost:3000/api/v1");
}

docs {
  Scenario: the window closes while the clock runs.
Expected: the clock pauses once at Processing Time To; the final sliper only counts up to To.
Status: VERIFIED by unit test.

  Run 00 Base Setup first (same session) so the shared vars are available.
}
